# This repository lives inside a full Magento install, but it only owns the
# Mktr modules plus the deploy/docs helper files. Ignore the Magento tree by
# default and explicitly allow the project files below.

*

!.gitignore
!mktr.sh
!readme.md
!themarketer-m2-specs-plan.md

!app/
!app/code/
!app/code/Mktr/
!app/code/Mktr/**

!docs/
!docs/**

!scripts/
!scripts/**

!pub/
!pub/media/
!pub/media/logo/
!pub/media/logo/**

.DS_Store
app/code/Mktr/Google/Google.zip
app/code/Mktr/Tracker/Tracker.zip
app/code/Mktr/Tracker/Storage*
!app/code/Mktr/Tracker/Storage/
!app/code/Mktr/Tracker/Storage/.gitkeep
